<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Ms. Griffith Joyner returns three weeks after starting levetiracetam. She has taken every dose. In the first ten days she felt short-tempered and more tired than usual after training; both are easing. She has had no seizure or spell. The neurosurgeon saw her last week and offered complete removal of the cavernous malformation with its hemosiderin rim through a left frontal craniotomy; she has chosen surgery, booked in three weeks. She wears the detection watch at night. She has not driven. She has had no thoughts of self-harm. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Levetiracetam</td><td>Every dose taken; irritability and tiredness easing</td></tr><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None since the flight</td></tr><tr><td>Neurosurgery</td><td>Lesionectomy offered and chosen; booked in three weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>Detection watch at night; not driving</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

