    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>More tired than usual after training, improving</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No seizures, spells, headache or dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Short-tempered in the first ten days, easing; sleep normal; PHQ-9 6; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Training without injury</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
